        "text": "{\"recorded_count\": 19, \"total_count\": 23, \"missing_ids\": [\"FT-6\", \"FT-21\", \"CS-23\", \"IX-18\"], \"complete\": false, \"results\": [{\"item_id\": \"FT-1\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created listing 'QA Upcycled Side Table' with photo, description, price $42.50, category Furniture, condition Good, location Seattle WA, upcycled toggle on. Detail page displays all submitted data correctly including Upcycled badge, category/condition tags, price, location, description, and listed date.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-2\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No edit functionality for existing listings\", \"actual\": \"On My Listings, each owned listing card only exposes 'View', 'Mark Sold', and 'Delete' actions (no Edit/Manage button that opens an editable form). The listing detail page for an owned item only shows a 'Manage Your Listings' button, which returns to the same View/Mark Sold/Delete list. There is no way found to modify title, description, photos, price, category, condition, or location of an existing listing.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-3\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Marked 'Mid-Century Modern Armchair' Sold (toast 'Item marked as sold', status badge changed to Sold, button became 'Mark Available'); toggled back to Available (toast 'Item marked as available'). Deleted 'Handmade Macrame Wall Hanging' after a confirmation dialog ('Delete listing? This action cannot be undone') - confirming showed 'Listing deleted' toast and the item was immediately removed from My Listings.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-4\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Emma: marked prod-1 'Mid-Century Modern Armchair' Sold and deleted 'Handmade Macrame Wall Hanging'; Browse count dropped from 10 to 8 items, neither appeared in grid. Switched to a different logged-in user (Marcus Chen, non-owner) via in-app logout/login: Browse still shows '8 items available', prod-1 absent from grid, and searching 'Armchair' returns '0 items available'/'No items found' - the sold item is fully unreachable via browse or search by another user, so it cannot be added to cart or requested.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registered Tim QA / timqa.tester@example.com / Seattle WA; got 'Account created successfully!' toast and was immediately signed in (header showed 'Tim QA' user menu, Sell button appeared).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Searching lowercase 'vintage' matched 2 titles containing 'Vintage' (case-insensitive title match): 'Vintage Denim Jacket - Size M' and 'Vintage Brass Floor Lamp'. Searching uppercase 'PORTLAND' matched 3 items whose location is 'Portland, OR' (case-insensitive location match), including items whose titles/descriptions don't contain the word. Clearing the search box restored the full 8-item result set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Marcus, clicked Add to Cart on prod-9 'Kids Wooden Train Set' (owned by Sofia, not Marcus). Toast 'Added to cart!' shown, header cart icon updated to '1'. Cart page (/cart) shows 1 item with correct title, photo, location 'Austin, TX', price $35, and Total $35.00.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Marcus (non-owner), on prod-9 'Kids Wooden Train Set' (owned by Sofia, available) clicked 'Message Seller', dialog 'Send a message to Sofia Martinez' opened with a textbox and disabled Send Message button. Typed a non-empty message; Send Message button became enabled; clicking it showed visible confirmation toast 'Message sent to seller!' and closed the dialog.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No seller-facing view of purchase requests or buyer messages\", \"actual\": \"As buyer Marcus, sent a purchase request via cart checkout (toast 'Purchase requests sent to sellers!') and a direct message via 'Message Seller' dialog (toast 'Message sent to seller!') for prod-9 owned by Sofia. Logged in as Sofia (the seller) and checked My Listings, the product detail page (owner view shows only 'Manage Your Listings'), and the header menu/icons - there is no requests inbox, message list, or any indicator/count showing the purchase request or buyer's message anywhere in the seller's UI. The confirmation toasts on the buyer side are the only evidence a request/message was sent; the seller has no way to view the requested item alongside the buyer's message.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login attempt with unregistered email 'nonexistent-user-9999@example.com' showed 'Invalid credentials' toast, stayed on /login, no session cookie created, header still shows Log in/Sign up when revisited.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Duplicate email (case-only variation) not rejected\", \"actual\": \"Registering a second account with 'TimQA.Tester@example.com' (case variant of already-registered timqa.tester@example.com) succeeded with 'Account created successfully!' toast and created a distinct signed-in account 'Tim Duplicate', instead of being rejected as a duplicate.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Incorrect password accepted\", \"actual\": \"Logging in as emma@example.com with an incorrect password ('definitelyWrongPassword999') succeeded, showing 'Welcome back!' toast and signing in as Emma Green, instead of being rejected.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"As Marcus Chen: viewing prod-2 (owned by Marcus) shows only 'Manage Your Listings' button (owner view, no Add to Cart/Message Seller). Viewing prod-9 'Kids Wooden Train Set' (owned by Sofia Martinez, not Marcus) shows 'Add to Cart' and 'Message Seller' buttons only - no Mark Sold/Delete/Manage options appear for a listing not owned by the signed-in user.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitting with only title filled focused the required Title field (native 'Please fill out this field' validation). Submitting with title/description/price filled but no photo/category/condition showed toast 'Please fill in all required fields' and did not create a listing.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price field is a number input with min=0; entering -5 triggered native validation 'Value must be greater than or equal to 0' and blocked submission (no listing created, stayed on /create-listing). Attempting to type non-numeric text 'abc' into the price field was rejected by the browser (input type=number), preventing non-numeric price entry entirely.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"No duplicate-account feedback shown\", \"actual\": \"Submitting registration with an already-used email (case variant) produced a success toast and navigated away from the registration form instead of showing duplicate-account error feedback.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into the search box updated the 'N items available' count and the results grid immediately on each keystroke/fill (e.g. 8→2 for 'vintage', 2→3 for 'PORTLAND') with no separate search/submit button; clearing the box immediately restored all 8 items.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking 'Add to Cart' immediately showed a toast 'Added to cart!' and updated the header cart icon badge from empty to '1' without any reload; navigating to /cart via the icon (in-app) immediately reflected the correct line item and $35.00 total with no manual refresh needed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Checked multiple listing detail pages (prod-9, prod-10, prod-7). Each consistently displays: photo, title (h1), description, price, category tag, condition tag, location with distance, seller name/location, listing date ('Listed YYYY-MM-DD'). Upcycled items (prod-10) show an 'Upcycled' badge overlay; non-upcycled items (prod-9) omit it, correctly reflecting status. Availability is conveyed consistently: active listings show functional Add to Cart/Message Seller buttons, while a Sold listing (temporarily set on prod-7 for verification, then reverted) explicitly shows 'This item is no longer available' text in place of purchase actions.\"}]}"
